{"title":"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the greatest integer less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and the least integer greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The solution set for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/0/a404eb234d5ab0e268cb7c15cc6f9d6816226464.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\Big\\{\\frac{5}{2}\\Big\\}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\big\\{x\\ |\\ 2 \\le x \\le 3\\big\\}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\big\\{x\\ |\\ 2\\le x &lt; 3\\big\\}\\qquad\\\\  \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\Big\\{x\\ |\\ 2 &lt; x\\le 3\\Big\\}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\Big\\{x\\ |\\ 2 &lt; x &lt; 3\\Big\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"73\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/d/a7dd0feb9f3e43deef353c5506fc9edd3d0e8534.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\leq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/b/42b76db80d72d8baacfe39a8c88f474bede08d27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x \\rfloor + \\lceil x \\rceil \\leq 2+2 &lt; 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"175\" height=\"20\" />, so there are no solutions with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/d/a7dd0feb9f3e43deef353c5506fc9edd3d0e8534.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\leq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/3/d83346814f3ed26dc1b3139c475facfd3be607fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/7/e97b4db9de08e674309bfbe533f47eaf56fa7d18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x \\rfloor + \\lceil x \\rceil \\geq 3+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"139\" height=\"19\" />, so there are also no solutions here. Finally, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/4/1143fb88e2dbbe070b38d017af9cbecdd1b79d8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2&lt;x&lt;3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/1/811912972cb09024021bfd2f68d61253356deaf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x \\rfloor + \\lceil x \\rceil = 2 + 3 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"172\" height=\"19\" />, so the solution set is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME\" title=\"1986 AHSME\">1986 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Proble